KG42.register("source_edge_archive-689434eff1e421dcff9747e4",{"id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R004::E::v141-c-R004-E002","paper":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding","rule_id":"v141-c-R004","rule_ref":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R004","record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R004-E002","source":"bidding.supply","target":"coordination.local_operator","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R004-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E07"]},"evidence_class":"S","provenance_gate":"direct_C_edge_with_constraint_and_source_excerpt","scientific_acceptance":false,"accepted_constraint_ids":["v141-c-R004-C002"],"held_constraint_ids":[],"semantic_review_status":"supported","source":"KG40-12aedc3eec573697","target":"KG40-404d7eddbf0fc37c","source_occurrence_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R004::V::bidding.supply","target_occurrence_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R004::V::coordination.local_operator","source_unit_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-a-M01-p2p-cda::bidding.supply","target_unit_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-a-M01-p2p-cda::coordination.local_operator","omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"coordination","context_text":"P2P community exchange during the CDA Agreement Period, for time slots in Target Time Period T.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E07"]},"active":true,"source_signature":"f0e438258ce54dd29599c9cc1ccf1838235b108a3c867055b6f819710f26b2c3","relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"source_science":{"mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01-p2p-cda","source_definition":"When local allocation leaves an ask partially unmatched, its offered quantity is updated to σ'_{s,t} = σ_{s,t} - σ_{b,t}. Scope: CDA order-book maintenance following a successful match for time slot t in the Target Time Period T. Condition: The ask is partially allocated: σ_{b,t} - σ_{s,t} \u003c 0. When the bid quantity exceeds the ask quantity in a successful CDA match, the fully allocated ask is removed from the order book. Scope: CDA order-book maintenance following a successful match for time slot t in the Target Time Period T. Condition: The matched bid quantity exceeds the ask quantity: σ_{b,t} > σ_{s,t}.","target_definition":"Demand bids arrive asynchronously at the community exchange. Scope: P2P community exchange during the CDA Agreement Period, for time slots in Target Time Period T. Supply asks arrive asynchronously at the community exchange. Scope: P2P community exchange during the CDA Agreement Period, for time slots in Target Time Period T.","constraints":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R004-C002","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"Supply asks arrive asynchronously at the community exchange. Scope: P2P community exchange during the CDA Agreement Period, for time slots in Target Time Period T.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["bidding.supply","coordination.local_operator"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E07"]}],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E05","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p04-c1r2__v141-a-M01-bidding","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":null,"anchor_text":"Fig. 2. The timeline for ancillary service provision As presented in Section 2, customers trade ener","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"A bid, which is submitted by a buyer, is represented by o_{b,t}(b_t, π_{b,t}, σ_{b,t}, τ_{b,t}), which means that the buyer b_t would like to by the σ_{b,t} (kWh) amount of electricity at the price π_{b,t} (£/kWh), and the bid arrives at the ‘exchange’ at the time τ_{b,t}. Note that the exchange is a centralized or decentralized platform set for P2P energy trading within the community. Similarly, an ask, which is submitted by a seller is represented by o_{s,t}(s_t, π_{s,t}, σ_{s,t}, τ_{s,t})."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E06","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p04-c1r3__v141-a-M01-matching","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":null,"anchor_text":"peach time slot t in the Target Time Period T, there is one order book. In seeach order book, the bi","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"condition"},"source_text":"Within the Agreement Period of CDA, bids and asks will arrive at the exchange asynchronously. After they arrive, the bids and asks are allocated in ‘order books’. Note that for the bids and asks associated with each time slot t in the Target Time Period T, there is one order book. In each order book, the bids are sorted in the descending order of the bid prices π_{b,t} and the asks are sorted in the ascending order of the ask prices π_{s,t}. For both bids and asks, if several ones have the same prices, they are sorted based on the arrival time - the later a bid/ask arrives, the lower it ranks."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E07","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p04-c1r3__v141-a-M01-matching","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":null,"anchor_text":"peach time slot t in the Target Time Period T, there is one order book. In seeach order book, the bi","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"condition"},"source_text":"Every time a bid/ask arrives at the exchange, it will be allocated in the corresponding order book based on the above-described principles, and then the exchange will try to match the bids and asks in the order book. If the following relationship is satisfied for a bid o_{b,t} and an ask o_{s,t}: π_{b,t} ≥ π_{s,t}, (1) then the following amount of electricity will be matched: σ_{matched,t} = min(σ_{b,t}, σ_{s,t}) (2)"}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"coordination","context_text":"P2P community exchange during the CDA Agreement Period, for time slots in Target Time Period T.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E07"]},"source_record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R004-E002","source":"bidding.supply","target":"coordination.local_operator","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R004-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E07"]},"paper_scope_note":"CDA, ancillary services, and residual agreement adjustment are kept separate; arrival events, matched orders, and the next ZIP update are not variables at the same time point; reward and compensation costs are different settlement sub-items."}});
